<div class="w-full h-full overflow-auto bg-stone-950">
  <div class="mx-auto flex w-full max-w-6xl flex-col gap-8 p-8">
    <header class="flex flex-col gap-1">
      <h1 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-100">Wanderer Desktop</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-stone-400">选择一个地图开始。</p>
    </header>

    <div
      :if={@maps == []}
      class="rounded border border-stone-800 bg-stone-900/60 p-8 text-center text-sm text-stone-400"
    >
      当前账号没有可访问的地图。请先在 Web 端创建地图或申请权限。
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
      <.link
        :for={map <- @maps}
        navigate={~p"/desktop/#{map.slug}"}
        class="group flex min-h-[160px] flex-col justify-between rounded border border-stone-800 bg-stone-900/70 p-5 transition hover:border-stone-600 hover:bg-stone-900"
      >
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
          <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-100 group-hover:text-white">
            {map.name}
          </h2>
          <p :if={map.description not in [nil, ""]} class="line-clamp-2 text-sm text-stone-400">
            {map.description}
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-4 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-stone-500">
          <span>{map.slug}</span>
          <span class="text-stone-300 group-hover:text-white">打开 →</span>
        </div>
      </.link>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
